Pass it along, let's see your pfp in its full sized glory!

@khayenarts.bsky.social did this wonderful piece for me - an homage to RM’s “Lost” from his most recent solo album. 

I wanted a way to bring my two favorite things together and Khayen executed it perfectly!!
